  "pitch": 7.4431888274506,
  "f0": 112.64533176746917,
  "text": "What broke? The server's disk corrupted a wait file, a stale library path crashed the compiler, and a faster setting for the expert math filled a layer with garbage, so it stayed off."
 },
 {
