  "id": "s08-06",
  "take": "s08-06",
  "ratio": 1.0,
  "dur": 15.046530612244897,
  "loud": 29.5952921712909,
  "pitch": 8.013003198215443,
  "f0": 122.5,
  "text": "What worked, one traced pass through the network for every frame, the audio decoder in a single trace, sampling on the card, a cached voice prompt and the codec on the card as well."
